    "cid": "5223",
    "title": "内容拓展·二",
    "category": 1,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·内容更新</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"643f3af35bfaa8af1929b02681797e98\" alt=\"新结局.png\" title=\"新结局.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20241030/643f3af35bfaa8af1929b02681797e98.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">开放全新作战关卡、主题关卡、事件、结局、收藏品、思绪等内容，期待您挑战</span>。</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·新增尘封遗物</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"302\" title=\"3.png\" alt=\"3.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20250108/84c5bdde999db895efd09898bcf9ddea.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>预言显像</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">你一定听说过这样一段文字：“我见你，头顶黑冠，将千万生灵，熬成回忆......”</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">终曲合声会在作战中出现。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>无终之钥</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">经由你的泉涌灵思，故事从虚无中诞生；经由你的枯竭想象，阿米娅将要终止万物。你的思想能够成为反抗她的武器吗？</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">让探索开启不同的方向。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">王命凡形</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">王各有命，形亦不同。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">护盾值+3，将剩余的生命值上限全部转化为等量护盾值，之后将最大生命值变为1。</span></span></p><p><br/><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">烟花之手</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">砰砰啪啪，意外之喜。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">【速射手】【回环射手】【哨戒铁卫】每次攻击命中时，有25%概率发射一枚额外子弹，造成相当于攻击力200%的群体物理伤害。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>衣卡兹</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">借由穿戴它的生物间激烈的竞争与攀比行为，衣卡兹群体正在茁壮成长。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">干员首次技能结束后立刻获得30点技力。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>罗德之门</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">这扇经过改造的“门”将两段故事紧紧连接到了一起，“门”的另一头是罗德戴尔——萨卡兹与感染者们的避风港。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">立即招募数名罗德岛预备干员，每场作战结束时，最后部署的干员会进入先行一步。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">······</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·新增分队和思绪</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"7fc384a369e0f26876d8f41a874bfb8a\" alt=\"1.png\" title=\"1.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20241030/7fc384a369e0f26876d8f41a874bfb8a.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>专业人士分队</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始招募时额外获得1张高级资深干员招募券，可以购买到高级资深干员招募券。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>绝望</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">“您一定能活下来的，请......相信......呜，呜呜呜......”</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">与构想解读获得拯救。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>拯救</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">“请在这里睡一会吧，等找到矿石病的解药，您就能健康地醒来了。”</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">与构想解读获得停止。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>停止</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">“等你们醒来时，就不会再有苦难了。而那之前的痛苦，我会背负。”</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可于不期而遇：孤注一掷中铸造。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·新增分队强化</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"90d1cd9a6ef028628a4d63b4995dec42\" alt=\"2.png\" title=\"2.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20241030/90d1cd9a6ef028628a4d63b4995dec42.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>蓝图测绘分队</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">刷新节点次数+1，每个节点的首次刷新不消耗构想，初始构想+1，初始希望+1。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>博闻广记分队</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始负荷临界点+10，初始希望+2，初始携带数个枯木新枝。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>魂灵护送分队</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">每进入新的一层，获得2缕灵感且负荷临界点+1，每使用一个灵感，负荷临界点+1，作战中如使用了灵感，干员再部署时间-12秒。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>点刺成锭分队</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">每进入新的一层，源石锭+5，首次刷新不消耗构想并出现诡意行商，击败&lt;年代之刺&gt;额外获得2源石锭，初始携带贪婪天平，进入诡意行商后获得1缕构想。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>拟态学者分队</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始希望+1，构想与遗愿或灵感解读时收藏品概率大幅增加且总会获得更稀有的收藏品，初始携带探灵伯爵。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·新增直面魂灵效果</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>直面魂灵·16</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">开通纵向通路消耗的构想+1。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>直面魂灵·17</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">进入灰铸迷城时，随机获得一个遭诅古物。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>直面魂灵·18</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">思维负担变为崩溃。</span></span></p><p></p>",
